{"cluster_id": "C-1907", "topic": "Every acquired ordinary GC invocation including", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B036-016", "B049-073"], "canonical_claim": "Every acquired ordinary GC invocation, including `DEFER`, runs exactly one independently paced `cas/ns/` janitor page and one later catalog cut while the hot immutable `RefPlan` still uses exactly one `cas/ns/stream/` LIST plus one later catalog cut.; A DEFER invocation may inspect one bounded namespace-janitor page under suppression, but it must retain a valid cursor so the next authorized fold retries that page.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/task-5-step8-cpp-report.md#scope", "docs/superpowers/models/CaNamespaceJanitorCursorCore_RESULTS.md#canamespacejanitorcursorcore-results"]}
