{"cluster_id": "C-1918", "topic": "C1 requires loop and heartbeatLoop to", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B023-057", "B050-068"], "canonical_claim": "[C1] requires `loop()` and `heartbeatLoop()` to check `isVanished()` at each wake and self-exit, preventing new GC rounds after `Vanished`. The GC scheduler exits at its next wake on `Vanished`, on published `vanished_intent`, and on `IdentityLost`; it does not join from a callback.", "issue_ids": ["C1", "C6", "T15", "rev.8"], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/tla-rev7-report.md#L67-L70", ".superpowers/sdd/tla-rev7-report.md#L8-L10", "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-22-cas-disk-lease-loss-throw-and-stop-verbs-design.md#L70-L79"]}
